window.products.push({"id":759249,"name":"Max Burton 6050 Induction Cooktop, Stainless Steel and Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dcv05wESL._AC_.jpg","description":"Max Burton 6050 Induction Cooktop Bundle, Includes 6200 Cooktop and 6010 Induction Interface, Stainless and Black The Max Burton Deluxe Induction Cooktop features an upgraded stainless body with 10 variable temperature settings from 100- 450F, 10 power levels from 500 - 1800 watts, and a 180-minute timer that will automatically shut down the unit when time has expired Safety features include an in-line fuse, overheat sensor, unsuitable cookware detector and over/under voltage sensor. Operates on 110/120 volt. Induction cookware is required, or use with the model 6010 Induction Interface Disk to use any cookware (included in this bundle) Induction cooking is safe because only the cooking surface gets hot where it comes in contact with the cookware. There is no open flame or exposed heating elements to burn people or surrounding fixtures making this ideal for young or old. In addition the kitchen stays cooler Key Features Operates on 110/120 volt Operates on 110/120 volt 6010 Induction Interface Disk to use any cookware is included in this bundle 6010 Induction Interface Disk to use any cookware is included in this bundle 10 variable temperature settings from 100- 450F, 10 power levels from 500 - 1800 watts 10 variable temperature settings from 100- 450F, 10 power levels from 500 - 1800 watts 180-minute timer that will automatically shut down the unit when time has expired, The automatic timer will sound an alarm 180-minute timer that will automatically shut down the unit when time has expired, The automatic timer will sound an alarm Made for use with cast iron, carbon steel, magnetic stainless steel or any other material with a built-in induction base cookware Made for use with cast iron, carbon steel, magnetic stainless steel or any other material with a built-in induction base cookware Cooktop features Overheat protection, non-suitable cookware detection, improper voltage supply detection for improved safety Cooktop features Overheat protection, non-suitable cookware detection, improper voltage supply detection for improved safety Specifications Power source: 120V, 15A, 60 Hz Power source: 120V, 15A, 60 Hz Wattage Range: 500 - 1800W Wattage Range: 500 - 1800W Cord Length: 5 feet Cord Length: 5 feet Glass cooktop dimensions: 9.75\" x 11.5\" Glass cooktop dimensions: 9.75\" x 11.5\" Weight: 12.5 Pounds Weight: 12.5 Pounds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dcv05wESL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max Burton","source_asin":"B003FPB3NU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003FPB3NU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003FPB3NU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":759250,"name":"Designs by Maria Black Women Motivational Wall Art - Unframed Artwork Decor for Home, Girls Bedroom, Living Room, Spa - Inspirational African American","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AQGGbpsHL._AC_SL1264_.jpg","description":"Looking for a nice art piece that will adorn your bare wall? Decorating a house may be fun, but it is not easy. With a plethora of art pieces on the market, it can be hard to choose the best ones for your home. Even if you find something that you absolutely love, you sometimes have to let it go if it doesn’t blend with your overall theme. The truth is, there are many wall art that have designs and use colors that go well with just about any home décor. You just have to find them. The good news is, we have something that’s worth taking a look at. Add color and character to your space with the Designs by Maria Black Women Bathroom Wall Art! Showcase your sophisticated taste in home décor with artwork that makes a statement. Our set of 4 wall art features black women pampering themselves in different ways. The unique concept is sure to give your guests something to talk about. Our unframed wall art is easy to clean. The simplest way to keep them looking pristine is by dusting them regularly with a dry brush with soft bristles. You can also use a white cotton cloth soaked in soapy water to remove grime. For best results, use olive oil-based soap. Weighing only 5 ounces each, our posters are very easy to move around. If you are redecorating your home or relocating, you won’t have a hard time carrying this set from one place to another. Moreover, it is easy to store. Just wrap each in brown paper under a bubble wrap. Still not convinced? Here are additional reasons to love these gorgeous posters: ✅ Takes only minutes to hang ✅ Makes a great focal point for your space ✅ Great for modern, rustic, boho, and traditional bathrooms Transform your space from drab to fab. Add the Designs by Maria Black Women Bathroom Wall Art to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AQGGbpsHL._AC_SL1264_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Designs by Maria Inc.","source_asin":"B09BMH3L24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BMH3L24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BMH3L24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
