window.products.push({"id":759343,"name":"Solid Hardwood Coffee Table Tray (Ash Wood), Extra Large Ottoman Tray (20” x 14”), Serving Tray with Handles (Cutout), Decorative Trays for Coffee Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811ATAaB3oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>✔ <b>Entertain like a seasoned host</b> – This extra large ottoman tray is the perfect size for all your hosting needs. At 20 x 14 x 2.5 inches, this solid hardwood coffee table tray is big enough to comfortably fit an entire plate setting for you or your partner and is deep enough to securely hold a good number of drinks for your family and friends. Also, it has wide cutout handles for easy carrying and simple maintenance. Just wipe clean with damp cloth</p> <p>✔ <b>Decorate like an interior designer</b> – When not entertaining, use these as decorative trays for coffee table or ottoman. Notice the interlocking joints of these wooden trays with handles. This detail is not just for adding strength but also gives this wooden tray more character when used as home decor. Choose Dark Ash to add a feature of modern interior design, Natural Ash to add an element of Scandinavian design or Rustic Ash if you’re aiming for farmhouse design for your home</p> <p>✔ <b>100% Real Wood</b> – This extra large wooden tray for ottoman is made entirely from solid wood with interlocking joints for extra durability. Unlike some serving trays for ottomans, we DO NOT use cheaper alternatives for the base such as plywood or MDF. Only natural hardwood from the Ash tree is used for its strength and shock resistance. The Ash tree is also native to North America so these wooden serving trays are not only built to last but will also age well in the local climate</p> <p>✔ <b>Give as a thoughtful gift</b> – This full-size serving tray with handles is a perfect wedding or housewarming gift. It is so versatile that this extra large serving tray for coffee table or ottoman can even be used to organize various items around the house. Also, it comes in a gift box for your convenience. Rest assured this is a superior quality product made from solid Ash wood, which is a natural hardwood like Walnut, unlike the typical wood tray that uses Pine or other softwood</p> <p>✔ <b>Satisfaction guarantee</b> – Actual color may vary due to the natural wood grain. We make our wooden tray for coffee table or ottoman to be loved and to last so we combine premium materials with quality craftsmanship. But if you are not satisfied with your new large tray for any reason then please let us know an we’ll do whatever we can to turn you into a happy customer.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811ATAaB3oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MONT SAINT-RAE","source_asin":"B07ZBGTNX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZBGTNX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZBGTNX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
