window.products.push({"id":759437,"name":"Staub Large Sauté Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/212F7H2KTHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Throughout the year, cast iron has proven itself a superior material for cokware over and over. At Staub we make the best cast iron material for all our designs. Cast iron heats evenly and retains heat, allowing lower cooking temperaturesand keeping your food warm hours after the oven has been turned off. The Saute pan can be used on any cooking surface. Amazon.com Outfitted for serious work yet handsome enough to invite to the table, Staub's cast-iron cookware brings restaurant-tested quality to discerning home chefs. This large sauté pan is one of the most versatile kitchen tools, shifting effortlessly from breakfast scrambles to dinner's shrimp and veggies to dessert fried bananas. With a double coating of enamel over the heavyweight metal, the pan provides uniform warming, superior heat retention, and rust resistance. Unlike more conductive metals like aluminum, it performs best at low to medium temperatures over longer time periods so flavors intensify and foods stay scrumptiously moist. The black matte finish is almost indestructible and doesn't need seasoning; rather, the oils produced in cooking seep into the surface pores to create an organic nonstick coating. The rougher matte texture also browns, braises, and reduces better than a shiny polished glaze. To steam or keep ingredients warm, a removable stainless-steel rack clips onto the rim in a half-circle shape. Lifting and transporting is easy and well balanced with the help of a lovely beechwood stick handle and a wide loop helper. Finished with a smooth bottom, the pan is suitable for all heat sources including glass stovetops and convection ovens. It goes safely into the dishwasher, though hand washing is recommended for heavy use. It is backed by Staub's lifetime limited warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/212F7H2KTHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAUB","source_asin":"B000JRA48C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JRA48C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JRA48C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
