window.products.push({"id":759485,"name":"Greyson Living Aldridge 48-Inch Rectangle Lift Top Coffee Table by","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yTMjGo-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Aldridge lift top coffee table delivers a rustic, yet elegant style to your living space. The medium cherry finish is accented by decorative metal plates and exposed rivets giving the table a slight industrial vibe. The top lifts up and pulls forward to be used for dining or work and reveals two hidden storage spaces perfect for remote controls or magazines. The spacious lower shelf can be used for storage or displaying treasured items.Material: Hardwood Solids, Mango VeneersFinish: Medium CherryIncludes (1) lift top coffee tableRustic, elegant style in medium cherry will complement many decorsStylish metal plate accents with exposed rivets add in industrial flareSpacious lower shelf is perfect for storage or displaying decorative itemsTop lifts up and pulls forward for dining or working while seatedSpring lift system ensures smooth and controlled open and closingTwo storage areas under the top are perfect for remote controlsSits on casters for easy movement for cleaning or re-arrangingCoffee Table Dimensions: 21 inches high x 48 inches wide x 28 inches deepAssembly required. This product ships in one (1) boxAccessories are NOT included Top Material: WoodShape: RectangleBase Type: LegsFrame Material: WoodType: Coffee TablesProduct Features: Lift TopMaterial: Wood, VeneerStyle: Casual, IndustrialAssembly: Assembly RequiredDesign: TableExact Color: CherryFinish: Cherry FinishColor: Brown Assembly Required","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yTMjGo-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greyson Living","source_asin":"B08XB42Z5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XB42Z5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XB42Z5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":759486,"name":"Kids Baking Kit by Baketivity + Highlights Magazine Booklet | Kindness Themed Baking Set for Kids | DIY Arts and Crafts Kids Baking Set | Heart Shaped","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ezMnokDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KIDS BAKING KIT Spend quality time in the kitchen with your kids, as they learn to bake delicious cookies, all on their own! The Kindness Kit comes with a kid-friendly recipe, all the pre-measured dry ingredients they’ll need, and a Mini Mag activity booklet created by the beloved Highlights magazine. CRAFTS FOR KIDS Move over scissors and glue, this is a whole new level of arts and crafts fun! Baketivity’s kids baking set is the perfect way for children to spend time together, welcome new neighbors or cheer up a friend. Everything is pre-measured, so all kids have to do is mix, cut heart shapes and pop the baking sheet in the oven! KIDS COOKING SETS Kids Baking Sets encourage motor skills development, boost problem solving techniques, and develop instruction-following skills. And see the self-esteem beam from your child’s face when those cookies come out of the oven! We’ve created an experience that helps parents use family time to encourage kindness, positivity and inclusivity. BEST BAKING GIFTS Your favorite little baker will love receiving the Kindness Kit as a birthday gift, and will feel oh-so-grown-up as they pour, mix, and bake! Contents: All dry ingredients for one recipe, 1 cookie cutter, 1 instruction brochure, 1 activity book. Great for ages 5+. HIGHLIGHTS Baketivity + Highlights Magazine have joined forces to deliver a sweet new way to spread a little kindness in the world with the Highlights inspired Kindness Kit. Baketivity baking kits were created to help you connect with those you love, in the language of the heart. Our kits help your baking time be convenient, mess-free, entertaining, and educational - all at once!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ezMnokDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baketivity","source_asin":"B09HVV3KTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HVV3KTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HVV3KTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
