window.products.push({"id":759591,"name":"Synra Lavender Buds, 0.5lb Resealable Bag, Blue Purple Dried Flowers, Useful for Teas & Baking, Great for Aromatherapy, Weddings, Satchels & Home Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WKZc1BriL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"High Quality, French Lavender Flower Buds --- Sweetly scented and super pretty, the Synra Lavender Buds arrive ready to use in a 0.5lb (230g) resealable plastic bag. These pretty purple blossoms are grown and picked from the fields in France before being carefully dried and packaged. The high quality lavender buds are dried to maintain the raw beauty of the flower. Gorgeous Blue Purple Color --- French lavender flowers have a remarkably beautiful color which is a unique blend of soft blues and brilliant purples. Lavender is often used as part of a bride's wedding colors or as a color theme for an elegant event. The Lavender Buds from Synra are a perfect complement and can be added to table centerpieces, handheld satchels and other homemade decorations. Encourages Relaxation --- Delicate and soothing, the exhilarating scent of lavender calms your mind and relaxes your body. The pleasing lavender aroma lowers your stress while promoting well-being. Using lavender in aromatherapy has been known to help with insomnia and high blood pressure. Delicious Addition To Tea And Baked Goods --- Because the dried lavender buds are edible and healthy to ingest, they make a great addition to many different cuisines, baked goods and drinks. Lemon bars, ice cream, vinaigrettes, lemonade and marinades are just a few of the ways to add dried lavender buds to your diet. Lavender tea can be made by steeping the dried flower buds in hot water for a soothing nighttime libation. Thoughtful Gift For Imaginative Friends --- There is such an array of exciting projects to create with the Synra Lavender Buds, making it an ideal gift for your creative friends and family members. Aromatics, infusions and craft projects are just a few ideas on how to use the delightful dried flowers. Present the sweet smelling lavender buds and let the creativity flow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WKZc1BriL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Synra","source_asin":"B07YBWJ86R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBWJ86R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBWJ86R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
