window.products.push({"id":759669,"name":"Sistema Lunch Collection Split Food Storage Containers, 1.5 Cup, Set of 3 in Assorted Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71voLA6GNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Millions of customers in over 100 countries around the world use Sistema products to help make their life a little easier.  From drink bottles to lunch boxes, microwave mugs to kitchen storage boxes everywhere, Sistema containers are used people find a purpose that suits their lifestyle. Sistema was built on one man's dream in his garage in small town New Zealand. That dream has now grown to include a team that spans the world. The vision to manufacture a beautifully designed, well made container in New Zealand and ship it to customers around the world has finally been realized. But our dream has not finished as we continue to innovate and design an ever increasing range of products manufactured to suit our customer's ever changing requirements. Be assured that every container that leaves our state of the art factory is made using virgin material that is both BPA and Phthalate free. All Sistema products are dishwasher (top rack), microwave (without lids), fridge and freezer safe. Taking the simple premise that customers want a well-made, beautifully designed, food safe storage container that would be stackable, the Sistema range was born. All of Sistema’s featured collections help make life a little easier: Klip It , Bake It, To Go, Microwave, Lunch, Hydrate and Storage. Look for the distinctive Sistema Klips on most products sold! Our Sistema Lunch range has everything covered for your lunch needs; smaller containers for younger kids or snacks, larger containers for sandwiches or salads and multi-compartment containers to keep food items separated until ready to eat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71voLA6GNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sistema","source_asin":"B01LYU3WKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYU3WKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYU3WKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":759670,"name":"Hand Carved Dotted Concentric Black 14-inch Mango Tree Wood Flower Vase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k2JM95jxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your floral display that modern finishing touch with a contemporary stunner vase. For this design, Thai artisan Saranya uses mango wood, which is a sustainable wood that grows abundantly in Thailand. A modern chic concentric pattern decorates this piece, creating a scintillating illusion touch of style. A beautiful bright color scheme graces the wood color while adding a stunning contrast. This versatile vase measures in with a height of 14 inches and would make an absolutely wonderful addition to any room in your home. PLEASE NOTE: The handcrafted nature of this product will produce minor differences in design, sizing and weight. Variations will occur from piece to piece, measurements may vary slightly. Packaged in AERAVIDA branded environmentally sustainable packaging. AERAVIDA works directly with gifted and talented Artisans from all over the world. At the core of our philosophy is fair trade and fostering a sustainable future for our Artisans. ARTISAN STORY: Sarunya has been drawing inspiration from the rich cultural heritage of her homeland to express her artistic talents for nearly ten years. She has a small workshop in Northern Thailand, where she and other family members practice their craftsmanship. At her workshop, only manual tools are used which helps achieve finely detailed work and artistry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k2JM95jxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AeraVida","source_asin":"B09CKXNX2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CKXNX2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CKXNX2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
