window.products.push({"id":759678,"name":"TunePhonik Horizontal Laser Cut Acrylic Record Dividers to Organize Vinyl up to 12” LPs Alphabetical Record Holder A to Z | Vinyl Cataloged Alphabetic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EArk35aUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ORGANIZE YOUR ALBUMS]: Precision laser cut clear acrylic LP dividers organize and alphabetize your LP record collection, so you can easily identify and pick the album you want to listen to, rather than having to search through stacks of record jackets to find the right album. [DURABLE ACRYLIC CONSTRUCTION]: Ideal for large collections on shelves; your separators are made of light, rugged acrylic designed to last decades. Functional and beautiful organization solution for vinyl fans, the dividers complement record album art and turn a stack or pile of records into a showpiece. [COMPLEMENT YOUR COLLECTION]: A lovely solution for vinyl enthusiasts, these partitions complement album art and turn piles of records into true showcases. Each partition’s surface is smooth to the touch with a beautiful clear finish and precise lettering that will complement any room’s decor. [FOR ALL RECORD SIZES]: Suitable for all albums sizes from 7” 45’s up to 12” LPs, these wooden record dividers are an ideal way to alphabetize hundreds of albums so you’ll be able to quickly find an album when you’re ready to relax and enjoy the rich vinyl sound. [NO ASSEMBLY REQUIRED]: Once unpacked, you can use your dividers with no assembly or labeling required, simply add them to your shelf of records. Your new separators are ready to be used with no hardware required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EArk35aUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TunePhonik","source_asin":"B0865YD6HH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0865YD6HH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0865YD6HH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
