window.products.push({"id":759697,"name":"GCIREC Modern Abstract Shower Curtain, Gold Blue Stripe Oil Painting Art Bathroom Curtains for Bathtub Decor Waterproof Fabric Machine Washable with 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sYY1c1lgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Waterproof Material This modern shower curtain for bathroom has upgraded the fabric. It not only has good waterproof effect to separate dry and wet in the bathroom, but also moderate weight, to keep a good draping feeling and not easy to be blown up by the wind. The most important thing is to achieve a good privacy protection effect, which can protect privacy and avoid embarrassment. It can be used with out a liner. Even when hold up to the light,it can not see through. High Definition Graphic Design Printed with advanced fade-less technology to ensure the clear pattern. This modern abstract shower curtain has the characteristics of no smell, non fading, safe and vivid colors. Fine Workmanship Reinforced upper and lower hem: this oil painting shower curtain is sewn with reinforced thread. Reinforcing stitches (also known as over-lock stitches) sew at the edges of one or two pieces of cloth for edge banding, crimping, or stitching, to ensure that the curtain will not fall when you shower. And it helps to keep the curtain in place and avoids blowing, letting it hang elegantly. The sturdy hem keeps the curtain from tearing up.High strength and elastic recovery, prolong service life. Care Tips Machine washable, do not bleach or dry clean. This art shower curtain can remain in good condition and durable after cleaning. If there are creases on the shower curtain, iron it gently. Package Including This abstract art shower curtain set comes in 1 pc shower curtain and 12 pcs hooks, easy to hang up and plastic hooks will not be rusted and can use for a long time. Warm Tips Due to manual measurement, the dimension may have slight error. Customized Service We provide customized service. If you need to customize other patterns, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sYY1c1lgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GCIREC","source_asin":"B09PH6TDKL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PH6TDKL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PH6TDKL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
