window.products.push({"id":759807,"name":"Luigi Bormioli Michelangelo Masterpiece 7-1/2-Ounce Martini Glasses, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315FX6RZSRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Luigi Bormioli used only the finest sands and raw materials to produce crystalline glass that is purely transparent, completely free from tarnishes, tints, and imperfections. Through an innovative cold-crack procedure and careful fire-polishing, the rims of Luigi Bormioli stems and tumblers retain the beadless edge found on the world's finest crystal. Designed with Italian precision and manufactured with Italian craftmanship, Luigi Bormioli's blown crystal glass provides you with the elegance and practicality that you deserve. Dishwasher safe yet beautiful enough for all of your entertainment needs, our stemware, tumblers and serveware allow you to experience fine Italian glassware while meeting the demands of your everyday life. Amazon.com A blue martini or a gimlet is just a little more suave when served in these thick, substantial Italian-made martini glasses with narrow bowls and a simple, rounded design. Each of the six glasses in this set holds 7-1/2 ounces and stands 6-3/4 inches tall. The Michelangelo Masterpiece martini glasses are made of lead-free crystalline and have the appearance of traditional glassblowing craftsmanship; however, they are created by machine using a glass fusion technology that produces a more flawless glass and does not impact the environment. The clarity of the glass is owed to the use of pure quartz sands with a high silica content. Rims are reinforced to discourage cracking or chipping and the glasses are dishwasher-safe for quick cleanup after a cocktail party. These glasses coordinate with a large line of other stemware in the Michelangelo Masterpiece series. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315FX6RZSRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luigi Bormioli","source_asin":"B0002D0SBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002D0SBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002D0SBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
