window.products.push({"id":759828,"name":"era85 Truu Design Ancient Traditional Terracotta Warrior Statue Set, 5 x 5 inches, Antique Bronze, 12 Pieces, Model Number: 27857DC-12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81escfNBqZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dating all the way back to the late third century, these Terracotta Warrior figures represent the armies of Qin Shi Huang, the first Emperor of China. It is a form of funerary art buried with the emperor with the intention of protecting the emperor in his afterlife. We carry two different sets of 12 pieces each that are made of high-quality, durable and longlisting polyresin. Each figurine features a high-level of detail and is coated in an antique bronze color that captures the beauty and history of ancient China. You will be able to easily identify the rank of the soldier by the intricately designed uniform. Besides adding them to your own collection, the statues will make a perfect gift to someone who admires Chinese culture and history or anyone who loves to collect unique pieces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81escfNBqZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Truu Design","source_asin":"B08NX4MBKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NX4MBKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NX4MBKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
