window.products.push({"id":759865,"name":"ZIMASILK 100% Pure Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin Health,,1pc (Queen 20''x30', Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vdBfiLxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ZIMASILK -silk pillowcase is crafted by 16 momme pure mulberry silk. Both sides of the pillowcase is organic and natural silk. It is designed with hidden zipper closure.With Queen(20x30inch) and King(20x36inch) and Stardard size in various kinds colours. It’s the most natural anti-aging product, hypoallergenic,smooth,soft,breathable. Prevent hair from becoming knotted and matted,have good sleeping,reduce facial wrinkles It’s absolutely healthy,chemical-free,naturally dyed,no color shading or fading. SILK INSTRUCTION: Dry cleaning or washing by hand are the best methods for cleaning silk for longer periods of time In contrast to the widespread opinion that silk can only be dry cleaned washing silk by hand or on a gentle or hand wash cycle can be done without causing any damage. If using a washing machine We recommend placing the garments in a mesh washing bag to avoide scratching or pulling of the garment. To wash by hand pls pay special attention to be the following instruction: Don’t use harsh detergents that contain bleaches or brighteners. Use cold to lukewarm water and mild soap such as Inory liquid soap@or baby shampoo. Add a few drops of hair conditioner to the final rinse water for an extra silk feel. Never spray silk with perfume or deodorant. Never Bleach SILK TO DRY: Wrap silk in a dry towel than lay flat Never wring dry Never expose silk to direct sunlight for longer periods of time TO IRON Always iron the backside only Never treat individual stains with water or spray silk with water while ironing Don’t iron at a high setting. TO SOTRAGE: Fold garment, To avoide a line running down the middle of a sweater fold each side of the sweater inward by a third. Smooth the arms down and fold in half.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vdBfiLxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZIMASILK","source_asin":"B071YHR687","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071YHR687","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071YHR687","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":759866,"name":"ALLZONE Room Divider Tension Curtain Rod,82-120 inch, No Drilling, Never Collapse, Very Secure, Brushed Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oVztez+2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALLZONE is the premier supplier of spring loaded tension rods on the market today. We have created a variety of tension rod sizes to help you find the perfect rod for your space. Our tension rods present such creative and easy way to hang curtains in minutes. No drilling required. Very Sturdy and Never Drop Down. Special treated against the rust and it can be Rust Free for many years. Simply adjust the rod to the size of your space and let the spring loaded tension do the rest! Specification: Material: Made by galvanized pole and brushed stainless steel,Anti-corrosion and rust free Size: Expands from 82-120'' as flexible. Installation:Free punching, no drilling required. Quick and Fast. Shipping List: 1.43-63''spring tension rod.2. 22'' extension short rod. 3. 40'' extension Long rod4. 2- Rubber end cap.5. 1-User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oVztez+2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALLZONE","source_asin":"B07288LNCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07288LNCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07288LNCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":759867,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice Stainless Steel Toaster Two Slice Toaster with Removable Crumb Tray Toaster Wide Slot Toasters 2 Slice Best Rated Prime with 7 Bread S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ocNyKznL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"UPGRADED VERSION TOASTER -- Toasters 2 Slice Best Rated Prime with 7 Bread Shade Settings and Bagel, Defrost, Cancel Function for Bagels, Waffles, Bread Exquisite Workmanship -- This toaster 2 slice has exquisite workmanship and is made of premium stainless steel that is non-toxic and BPA free. Compact Toaster -- This stainless steel toaster has a compact design that is easy to store and doesn't take up space. Extra Wide 2-Slot Toaster -- Toasters 2 slice best rated prime featured with 1.4in wide slot, making it suitable for various bread types. Multi-function Buttons -- Two slice toaster with user-friendly buttons have defrost/ cancel/ bagel functions and 7 shade settings to meet your various toasting needs. Removable Crumb Tray -- Bread crumbs are collected in a removable tray at the bottom of the stainless steel toaster. Fuss-free Cord Wrap -- The concealed cord wrap underneath the two slice toaster to manage unsightly power cords when finished using it. (The power cord length is 80cm) Automatic Pop Up & Lifting Lever -- When it's done, the bread will pop out of the toaster 2 slice, and the two slice toaster also comes with a lifting lever. How to use this toaster? ① Place the bread into the slots. ② Set the browning control to your desired setting. ③ Press the lift lever down. ④ The lift lever will pop up automatically when toasting is finished. WARM TIPS ① Please keep the toaster out of the reach of children ② Be sure to cut off the power after using the toasters ③ Do not touch the toaster slot with your hands ABOUT US We'll try our best to solve your problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ocNyKznL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iFedio","source_asin":"B0BG71PFWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG71PFWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG71PFWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":759868,"name":"Candlecopia Nag Champa Strongly Scented Hand Poured Vegan Candle, Status Jar, Glass Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919wLUmaOEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We think you'll really like Nag Champa - Woody notes similar to patchouli, with touches of powder, musk, amber, and vanilla. All Candlecopia products are made with care in the U.S.A by folks like you, who really like candles and who care about the environment. Our products will fully melt and will abundantly throw fragrance for many, many hours. Candlecopia is a Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business (SDVOSB) and a Women-Owned Small Business (WOSB). Please try our product and leave your feedback. DIRECTIONS: Place on heat and stain resistant surface. Trim wick to 1/4' before lighting. Allow wax pool to reach perimeter then extinguish after and allow to cool. Discontinued use when 1/2' wax remains. WARNING: To prevent fire burn candle within sight. Keep out of reach of children and pets. Never put on or near any thing that can catch fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919wLUmaOEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candlecopia","source_asin":"B01GEV5ZN0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GEV5ZN0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GEV5ZN0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
