window.products.push({"id":759885,"name":"goodat 13.5 Inch Portable Desk Fan with LED Lantern Battery Operated Fan Rechargeable Folding Personal Fan Ultra Quiet 3 Speed Adjustable Strong Wind ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719SIRg+v8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 LED LIGHTING SETTING& USB CHARGING】The table fan also has 2 bright led light modes (bright light level-weak light level). The light is 0.5w, the bright light level can last 10 hours and the weak light level lasts 40 hours. The fan has two separate buttons, you can enjoy the brightness and coolness at the same time or separately. With USB charging port, the fan can be connected to power bank, car charger, computer etc. 【SMALL FLOOR & TABLETOP FAN】 The air circulator fan provides coolness with quiet operation. With 3 speed modes and 2 lighting settings, the fan is powerful enough to provide coolness and brightness at the same time. The quiet oscillating table fan has a compact & modern aesthetic design, which will fit in your bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, office, or any medium or small room. 【CUSTOMIZE YOUR COMFORT】The quiet oscillating table fan provides multiple options for you, you’ll always be cool. This LED desk fan provides 3 speed modes (strong wind-medium wind-low wind). Strong wind can last 6 hours and the speed reaches 3.8m/s. Medium - 8 hours and the speed reaches 3.3m/s, and low wind -10 hours and speed 2.8m/s. With 180° rotation fan head, you can enjoy coolness wind form any direction. This compact fan is great as a fan for a bedroom, nightstands, desks and more. 【LARGE CAPACITY & INTELLIGENT RPOTECTION】Portable desk fan is powered by lithium 7800 mAH battery, it can be fully charged in 4-6 hours. Using our fan to help improve coolness and energy savings at home, bedroom or office. The fan has intelligent charging protection (overcharge--over-discharge protection), which ensures safety for your use. The fan also has clear indicator for your convenience. If the fan is charging, the power indicator will be red, and fully charged-green. 【HIGH QUALITY& 1 YEAR WARRANTY】The fan is of high quality and advanced techniques. Advanced motor works quietly at the speed of 2000 r/m. Multiple power supply and intelligent charging protection ensures safety and coolness for you both indoors and outdoors. Clear indicator, Easy operation. If you are not satisfied with our fan, please contact us at any time, we have 24 hours customer service and also offer 1-year warranty. We’ll refund to you or replace a new one for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719SIRg+v8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"goodat","source_asin":"B09YRWJY1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRWJY1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRWJY1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
