window.products.push({"id":759963,"name":"Lenox Forevermore Silver-Plated 2-Piece Dessert Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31F49ATGDKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Picture perfect... Slicing the first piece of wedding cake is always a fond memory - and a favorite photo in your wedding album. So, of course, you want a serving set as special as the day itself. This silverplated Lenox knife and server will be a beautiful part of the photograph... and of celebrations for years to come. Length of knife: 13 1/4\", server: 11\" Amazon.com Lenox's Forevermore accessories fill the most romantic day of your life with keepsakes to cherish for a lifetime. The two-piece dessert set glows with a bright mirror polish and includes a 13-1/4-inch knife and an 11-inch pie/cake server to help distribute your special dessert to loved ones celebrating your wedded bliss. Each handle features a raised heart design that swoops elegantly from the narrow neck to the gently rounded end. The silver-plated finish feels pleasantly weighty in the hand and requires minimal care to look wonderful at future special occasions, like anniversaries and baby showers. Nestled in a felt-lined box, this lovely set stores easily and makes a perfect gift. In use, it should be washed by hand to preserve the finish. Also add Forevermore's champagne flutes to toast the wedding cake, and remember the celebration with the coordinating wedding album and picture frame. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31F49ATGDKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B0007ZQHIC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007ZQHIC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007ZQHIC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
