window.products.push({"id":759968,"name":"PAUDIN Steak Knife Set of 8, Kitchen Steak Knives 4.5 Inch, High Carbon Stainless Steel Serrated Steak Knife Set with Full Tang Forged Blade & Black A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vojaNdN9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【Premium Steak Knife Set】: Steak knives set of 8 is perfect for cutting meat, turkey, pork and poultry, especially beef and steak, also suitable for all occasions such as dinner, barbecue, party, wedding and kitchen, camping, restaurant, hotel, etc. With PAUDIN Steak knives, you can cut effortlessly and enjoy your mealtime with family! ★【High Carbon Stainless Steel】: 8 piece steak knife set is made of high carbon German stainless steel, that is high-tech vacuum heat treated and nitrogen cooled to a hardness of 56+, providing superior strength, edge retention, durability and rust resistance for a long service life. Stainless steel steak knife blades for precise, effortless cutting and slicing, easy to clean after use, no need for frequent sharpening, always stays sharp and shiny! ★【Ultra Sharp Serrated Edge】: The serrated steak knives blade is forged at 14-16 degrees on one side with a hand-polished edge, keep the perfect sharpness and maximum elasticity. The widened serrated blade with clear serration spacing and strong cutting force, can easily cut meat without tearing and retain the original taste of food. ★【Ergonomic Full Tang Knife】: The humanized design black full tang handle is precisely polished, smooth and not easy to scratch, triple riveted provides perfect balance, excellent strength, durability. Each steak knife is lightweight, easy to grip, non-slip, reduces wrist stress, and is stable and flexible when cutting meat. The classic steak knife set works perfectly with other kitchen tools, is also a table decoration. ★【Ideal Gift Choice & Lifetime Warranty】: Kitchen knives set includes 8 pieces 4.5 inch steak knife with a beautiful packing box, making it a excellent gift on Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year's Day, birthdays, anniversaries and other occasions. If you have any questions about the serrated knife set, please feel free to contact us, PAUDIN knives offer 100% Satisfaction or Refund Policy against defects in materials and workmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vojaNdN9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAUDIN","source_asin":"B0BYYVMQ34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-759968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYYVMQ34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYYVMQ34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
